 * Order of Sections:
 * 1. All Cards (Overall Index, 2026 SLA, Backlog SLA, On-Target Completion)
 * 2. Change Factory Index & SLA Executive Visualizer (Owner Performance Analytics Graph)
 * 3. HOD Team Performance & Department Overview (Departmental breakdown & SLA)
 * 4. Details Table (Full Change Factory Index Table matrix with TOTAL row)
 */
